## Retail intelligence

EmoSpace is an emotional analysis service for physical spaces like shops, classes, museums, and shopping malls. It gives space owners actionable insights to improve and personalise customer experience.

We are in a time when online and offline are merging and customer experience demands are changing. The traditional store owner is feeling left out.

## How it works

The system uses in-store security cameras and context information (weather, events, shopping patterns, competitors, online prices) to build an information base using commercially available cloud AI platforms. The data is analysed for patterns and presented to the shopkeeper through a unique three-level information architecture.

## Privacy first

EmoSpace does not store any personal data — it is impossible to use it to identify customers. It performs simple recognition on the CCTV stream (gender, age, emotion signs) and images are discarded after processing. The system is designed to follow GDPR and other privacy regulations.

## Daily store stories

Instead of bombarding the shopkeeper with data, EmoSpace delivers a brief daily summary with three levels of depth — summary, review, and charts — that can be consumed on the commute home.

Check out the [web app](http://rohitg.in/emospace/).
